#: b0014985d30342a7a5237b5aec46b9c4 of utils.core.discovery:1
msgid ""
"Static registration discovery: scans source code without importing "
"modules to build a name->module lazy index."
msgstr ""
"Static registration discovery: scans source code without importing "
"modules to build a name->module lazy index."

#: b6685162f5644ae8adcdc77617143c99 of utils.core.discovery:3
msgid ""
"Scans for ``@register_<role>(\"name\")`` decorators and populates the "
"corresponding registry's ``index``. This allows ``keys()`` to list all "
"components at startup while component code is only imported on ``get()`` "
"(lazy loading, multi-environment safe)."
msgstr ""
"Scans for ``@register_<role>(\"name\")`` decorators and populates the "
"corresponding registry's ``index``. This allows ``keys()`` to list all "
"components at startup while component code is only imported on ``get()`` "
"(lazy loading, multi-environment safe)."

#: c4d7b8b974f341169a86f3673cf72ffb of utils.core.discovery:7
msgid ""
"Only recognizes the uniform ``@register_<role>(\"literal\")`` form; non-"
"literal arguments (variables, expressions) are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Only recognizes the uniform ``@register_<role>(\"literal\")`` form; non-"
"literal arguments (variables, expressions) are ignored."

